// QXZ UI 引擎示例：EXCOYZNVM 主界面（布局对齐设计稿 01/05：左菜单 + 账户区）
// 运行: qxz run examples/ui_main_screen.qzm
ui main_screen {
    direction: "row";
    width: "fill";
    height: "fill";
    bg: "#FFFFFF";

    panel left_menu {
        width: 180;
        direction: "column";
        gap: 4;
        padding: 8;
        bg: "#F5F5F5";
        border: 1;
        border_color: "#CCCCCC";

        text app_title { value: "EXCOYZNVM"; bold: true; font_size: 18; color: "#333333"; align: "center"; }
        button about { label: "关于"; bg: "#FFFFFF"; color: "#000000"; border: 1; }
        button world { label: "世界"; bg: "#FFFFFF"; color: "#000000"; border: 1; }
        button resource { label: "资源中心"; bg: "#FFFFFF"; color: "#000000"; border: 1; }
        button settings { label: "设置"; bg: "#FFFFFF"; color: "#000000"; border: 1; }
        divider div1 { }
        button exit { label: "△ 退出"; bg: "#FFE4E1"; color: "#CC0000"; border: 1; }
    }

    panel account_area {
        width: "fill";
        direction: "column";
        gap: 8;
        padding: 16;
        align: "stretch";

        text greeting { value: "欢迎回来，矿工"; font_size: 20; color: "#1E88E5"; bold: true; }
        panel stats_row {
            direction: "row";
            gap: 12;
            height: 40;
            text stat1 { value: "等级 12"; color: "#2E7D32"; }
            text stat2 { value: "金币 3,280"; color: "#F9A825"; }
            text stat3 { value: "矿石 145"; color: "#6D4C41"; }
        }
        button start_game { label: "开始游戏"; bg: "#4CAF50"; color: "#FFFFFF"; height: 44; font_size: 18; }
        button continue_save { label: "继续上次存档"; bg: "#8D6E63"; color: "#FFFFFF"; height: 36; }
    }
}
